---

## push_to_acr.py 完整参数

```bash
python tools/push_to_acr.py -u <user> -p <password> --tag v4 [--no-push]
```
流程：`docker login` → `docker build -t sft-base:v4 .` → `docker tag` → `docker push`

## Dockerfile.sft 预装依赖清单

transformers, datasets, accelerate, peft, bitsandbytes, torchvision, scipy, einops, sentencepiece, nltk, rouge_score 等。基础镜像 `pytorch/pytorch:2.5.1-cuda12.4-cudnn9-runtime`。

---

## 读完本 skill 后

- 构建中遇到问题 → `docker_traps.skill`
- Apptainer 运行原理 → `docker_apptainer.skill`
- 训练镜像使用者 → `SFT.skill`
